{"id":"1880073d-471a-4dfc-9260-fddb0370b418","createdAt":"2026-10-26T11:50:16.559Z","batchId":"pricing_minimax-m3-1-flash-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"minimax-m3.1-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <style>\n    .pricing-hero{text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}\n    .pricing-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.6rem);margin-bottom:.5rem}\n    .pricing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem;align-items:stretch}\n    .pricing-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative}\n    .pricing-card.featured{border:2px solid var(--primary);box-shadow:0 14px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.12);transform:translateY(-8px)}\n    .popular-label{position:absolute;top:0;right:1rem;transform:translateY(-50%)}\n    .plan-price{font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1;margin:.35rem 0}\n    .plan-price span{font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted)}\n    .feature-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:.7rem}\n    .feature-list li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:.6rem}\n    .feature-list li::before{content:\"✓\";color:var(--success);font-weight:800}\n    .pricing-card .btn{margin-top:auto}\n    .billing-toggle{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:.3rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface-2)}\n    .billing-toggle button{border:0;background:transparent;padding:.45rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}\n    .billing-toggle button.active{background:var(--primary);color:#fff}\n    .enterprise-note{text-align:center;padding:1rem;border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:12px}\n    @media(max-width:760px){.pricing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pricing-card.featured{transform:none}}\n  </style>\n\n  <section class=\"pricing-hero stack gap-sm\">\n    <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Simple, transparent pricing</span>\n    <h1>Choose the plan that fits your workflow</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Start for free, upgrade when you need more collaboration, control, and flexibility. Every plan includes a 14-day Pro trial.</p>\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"billing-toggle\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Billing frequency\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"active\" data-billing=\"monthly\">Monthly</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-billing=\"yearly\">Yearly · save 20%</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"pricing-grid\" aria-label=\"Pricing plans\">\n    <article class=\"card pricing-card\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"card-title\">Free</h2>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">For individuals getting started.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">$0 <span>/ month</span></div>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Free forever. No credit card required.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3>Everything you need to begin</h3>\n        <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n          <li>Up to 3 projects</li>\n          <li>Unlimited tasks and notes</li>\n          <li>Basic progress tracking</li>\n          <li>2 GB file storage</li>\n          <li>Community support</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\" href=\"#signup-free\">Start for free</a>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card pricing-card featured\">\n      <span class=\"badge popular-label\">Most popular</span>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"card-title\">Pro</h2>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">For professionals ready to do their best work.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price\"><span class=\"monthly-price\">$15</span> <span>/ month</span></div>\n          <p class=\"small muted\"><span class=\"yearly-price\" hidden>$12</span> Billed monthly or annually.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3>More power for focused work</h3>\n        <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n          <li>Unlimited projects</li>\n          <li>Advanced timeline and reporting</li>\n          <li>Custom fields and templates</li>\n          <li>100 GB file storage</li>\n          <li>Priority email support</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-block\" href=\"#signup-pro\">Start Pro trial</a>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card pricing-card\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"card-title\">Team</h2>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">For teams that need to move together.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price\"><span class=\"monthly-price\">$30</span> <span>/ user / month</span></div>\n          <p class=\"small muted\"><span class=\"yearly-price\" hidden>$24</span> Minimum of 5 seats.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3>Collaboration without the overhead</h3>\n        <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n          <li>Everything in Pro</li>\n          <li>Unlimited file storage</li>\n          <li>Roles and permissions</li>\n          <li>Team dashboards and goals</li>\n          <li>Guest access and audit log</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\" href=\"#signup-team\">Start Team trial</a>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"enterprise-note stack gap-sm\">\n    <h3>Need more than 20 people?</h3>\n    <p class=\"muted\">We’ll tailor security, onboarding, billing, and support to your organization.</p>\n    <div><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"#contact-sales\">Contact sales</a></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <p class=\"small muted center\">Prices exclude applicable taxes. You can cancel or change your plan at any time.</p>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('[data-billing]');\n  const monthlyPrices = document.querySelectorAll('.monthly-price');\n  const yearlyPrices = document.querySelectorAll('.yearly-price');\n\n  buttons.forEach(button => {\n    button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      buttons.forEach(item => item.classList.remove('active'));\n      button.classList.add('active');\n\n      const yearly = button.dataset.billing === 'yearly';\n      monthlyPrices.forEach(price => price.hidden = yearly);\n      yearlyPrices.forEach(price => price.hidden = !yearly);\n    });\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[2985,"<main class=\"page st"],[2985,"ack gap-lg\">\n  <styl"],[3134,"e>\n    .pricing-hero"],[3145,"{text-align:center;m"],[3145,"ax-width:760px;margi"],[3145,"n:0 auto}\n    .prici"],[3156,"ng-hero"],[3156," h1{font-size:clamp("],[3156,"2.2rem,5vw,3.6rem);m"],[3177,"argin-bottom:.5rem}\n"],[3187,"    .pricing-grid{di"],[3214,"splay:grid;grid-temp"],[3224,"late-columns:repeat("],[3240,"3,minmax(0,1fr));gap"],[3250,":1rem;align-items:st"],[3290,"retch}\n    .pricing-"],[3300,"card{display:flex;fl"],[3325,"ex-direction:column;"],[3335,"position"],[3335,":relative}\n    .pric"],[3372,"ing-card.featured{bo"],[3382,"rder:2px solid var(-"],[3442,"-primary);box-shadow"],[3452,":0 14px 36px rgba(0,"],[3492,"0,0,.12);transform:t"],[3502,"ranslateY(-8px)}\n   "],[3555," .popular-label"],[3570,"{position:absolute;t"],[3625,"op:0;right:1rem;tran"],[3632,"sfor